"########################################################################################\n"
"\n"
"■ 建置公司內部已導入 OSS 清單\n"
"\n"
"公司內部已導入 OSS 清單是本指南的核心部分。請建置以下要素。\n"
"\n"
"建置重點：\n"
" * 決定要設核准流程，或交由個人裁量（許多企業採用的方式是：以開發者自主判斷為基本，只在授權條款需確認事項較多時建議諮詢）\n"
" * 明確寫出清單的位置與格式（公司內部 Wiki、入口網站、管理系統等）\n"
" * 建立定期檢視流程，避免清單過時\n"
"\n"
"若初期階段清單還不完備，先從調查目前的使用狀況開始、再分階段充實，是比較務實的做法。\n"
"為避免造成「清單上沒有的 OSS 就不能使用」的誤解，請明確寫出清單屬於參考資訊。\n"
"\n"
"■ 把常見判斷失誤化為公司內部案例\n"
"\n"
"以實際的公司內部案例具體化，說服力會更高。\n"
"\n"
"案例化與具體化的重點：\n"
" * 分享公司內部的失敗案例（例如：「A 部門原本選了 X，後來因授權問題改用 Y」等）\n"
" * 具體化判斷基準（例如重視最後更新日期或 Issue 回應速度等）\n"
" * 明確公司內部採用 OSS 的判斷基準（因為程式碼量較少的專案，未必一定要選用 OSS）\n"
"\n"
"■ 建置諮詢體制\n"
"\n"
"OSPO 的角色是提供支援與指引，讓企業的 OSS 使用最佳化。\n"
"為避免支援工作過度膨脹，請考量以下事項建置體制。\n"
"\n"
"建置時的考量事項：\n"
" * 設定從諮詢到回覆的標準前置時間\n"
" * 建立緊急狀況的快速應對流程\n"
" * 標準化決定事項的文件化與公司內部共享方式\n"
" * 把常被諮詢的主題做成 FAQ 並建立知識庫\n"
" * 透過把溝通流程化來提升效率\n"
"\n"
"重點是要明確傳達：最終的技術選擇責任在開發團隊。\n"
"\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"-->"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/oss-inventory.md:1
msgid "# Approved Internal OSS Inventory"
msgstr "# 公司內部已導入 OSS 清單"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/oss-inventory.md:3
msgid "## Approved Internal OSS Inventory"
msgstr "## 已導入 OSS 清單"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/oss-inventory.md:7
msgid ""
"- [ ] Formulated policy on publishing an approved internal catalog.\n"
"- [ ] Established management tools for the inventory (internal wiki, component management system, etc.).\n"
"- [ ] Established maintenance and update workflows for catalog entries.\n"
"- [ ] Provided direct links to internal component management systems if available."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] 已決定是否製作與公開這份清單的方針\n"
"- [ ] 已決定清單的管理方式（公司內部公開管理、元件清冊系統等）\n"
"- [ ] 已建立清單的更新與維護流程\n"
"- [ ] 若已有公司內部元件清冊系統，已寫出導向該系統的說明"

#. type: 註解
#: operation-templates/using/oss-inventory.md:8
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"Customization Guide\n"
"\n"
"Guidance for expanding and refining content to match your company context following placeholder replacement.\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"\n"
"■ Inventory Strategy\n"
"\n"
"Deciding whether to publish an internal catalog depends on corporate strategy.\n"
"Centralizing an approved inventory strengthens governance and developer velocity, but risks creating a misconception that \"unlisted software cannot be used.\"\n"
"If an internal component registry or SCA platform exists, link directly to it.\n"
"Balance maintenance overhead against governance benefits when finalizing strategy.\n"
"\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"-->"
msgstr ""
"<!--\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"客製化指南\n"
"\n"
"以下說明在佔位符替換之後，依自家公司狀況進行增補與調整的指引。\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"\n"
"■ 評估清單製作方針\n"
"\n"
"如「使用 OSS」中「開放原始碼運用的基本流程」指南所述，要不要製作這份清單取決於企業方針。\n"
"在公司內部管理清單有強化 OSS 使用治理、提升開發者便利性的效果。\n"
"另一方面，也有造成「清單上沒有的 OSS 就不能使用」這種誤解的風險。\n"
"若已有公司內部的元件清冊系統，也請考慮導向該系統。\n"
"請在評估清單維護管理的負擔與好處之間的平衡後再判斷。\n"
"\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"-->"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:1
msgid "# Procuring OSS from Suppliers"
msgstr "# 自供應商取得 OSS 的程序"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:3
msgid ""
"Procuring software containing open source software (OSS) from third-party suppliers requires structured management workflows.\n"
"Unmanaged supplier OSS usage risks introducing severe post-delivery compliance violations and security vulnerabilities, jeopardizing project success."
msgstr ""
"從供應商採購軟體時，若該軟體含有開放原始碼軟體 (OSS)，就需要適切的管理流程。\n"
"若供應商對所使用 OSS 的選用與授權管理不當，交付後才發現重大合規問題或資訊安全風險，就可能對整個專案造成嚴重影響。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:4
msgid "This guide provides practical procedures for procuring software containing OSS from suppliers—covering contract terms through post-delivery verification to minimize operational risk."
msgstr ""
"本指南說明從供應商取得含 OSS 軟體時的實務程序。\n"
"從契約階段的約定到交付後的驗證，提供在把風險降到最低的同時有效率推進採購的指引。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:5
msgid "## Supplier Procurement Workflow"
msgstr "## 自供應商取得 OSS 的基本流程"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:6
msgid "Procuring software containing OSS requires a phased approach:"
msgstr "從供應商取得含 OSS 的軟體時，以下的分階段做法相當重要。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:7
msgid "**Pre-Procurement Contracting and Alignment**"
msgstr "**取得前的準備與約定**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:8
msgid "Establishing clear OSS policies and review workflows during contract negotiations prevents post-delivery licensing surprises and costly rework."
msgstr ""
"在下訂階段就明確 OSS 使用的方針與程序，對防止後續糾紛很有效。\n"
"若在約定含糊的情況下推進開發，之後才發現授權問題，就有大幅返工的風險。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:9
msgid "**Post-Delivery Verification and Remediation**"
msgstr "**取得後的驗證與處理**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:10
msgid "Conducting thorough verification upon delivery in accordance with contract terms ensures rapid remediation of identified issues."
msgstr "對交付的軟體，依事前約定進行適切驗證，並事先建立發現問題時的處理程序，相當重要。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:11
msgid "## Pre-Procurement Alignment Requirements"
msgstr "## 取得前應決定的事項"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:12
msgid "Establish and record mutual agreement with suppliers on the following items prior to contract execution or development kickoff:"
msgstr "在與供應商簽約前，或著手開發前的階段，需要明確並取得共識的事項如下。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:13
msgid "**Scope of Permitted Usage**"
msgstr "**使用許可的範圍**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:14
msgid ""
"While permitting supplier OSS usage, establish pre-use notification requirements as a baseline.\n"
"Tier review requirements by license risk—permissive licenses (MIT, BSD) require streamlined checks, whereas copyleft licenses (GPL, AGPL) demand rigorous evaluation regarding architectural impacts on proprietary codebases."
msgstr ""
"建議在認可供應商使用 OSS 本身的同時，對所使用的 OSS 以事前確認為原則。\n"
"在此之上，義務較少的授權條款（MIT、BSD 等）OSS 需確認的事項相對有限，而有原始碼提供義務的授權條款（GPL、AGPL 等）則需謹慎評估對自家產品的影響；依授權條款種類訂出審查基準，運作起來會比較順暢。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:15
msgid "For license details, see [What Is a License?](../compliance/what-is-a-license.md) and [Licenses with Source Code Disclosure Obligations](../compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md)."
msgstr "授權條款的細節請參閱[什麼是授權條款](../compliance/what-is-a-license.md)與[有原始碼提供義務的授權條款](../compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md)。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:16
msgid "**Pre-Consultation and Approval Processes**"
msgstr "**事前諮詢與核准流程**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:17
msgid "Define approval workflows for suppliers adopting new OSS components:"
msgstr ""
"定義供應商採用新 OSS 時的諮詢與核准流程。\n"
"以下這種分階段做法較為常見："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:18
msgid ""
"- **Early Notification**: Mandate that suppliers disclose proposed OSS components prior to development.\n"
"- **Clear Criteria**: Provide explicit guidelines detailing restricted license terms and security standards.\n"
"- **Reference Catalog Sharing**: Share approved internal OSS inventories as reference guidelines. Note that because license implications depend on specific deployment contexts, suppliers remain responsible for conducting independent compliance reviews."
msgstr ""
"- **實施事前諮詢**：建立機制，讓供應商在開發開始前就其考慮採用的 OSS 進行諮詢\n"
"- **明示判斷基準**：在可行範圍內明確哪些條件需要注意、判斷的觀點是什麼\n"
"- **提供已導入 OSS 清單作為參考**：若公司內部已有評估、導入過的 OSS 清單，可作為參考資訊共享。不過，使用條件會因商業使用情境與其他軟體的組合而改變，供應商端仍需進行個別確認"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:19
msgid "### OSS Inventory Submission Requirements"
msgstr "### OSS 清單的提交要求"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:20
msgid "**Submission Milestones**"
msgstr "**提交時機**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:21
msgid "Define explicit milestones for suppliers to submit OSS inventories:"
msgstr ""
"訂出要請供應商在何時提交所使用 OSS 清單。\n"
"常見的時機包括："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:22
msgid ""
"- **Architecture Review Phase**: Submit proposed OSS inventories upon finalizing architecture designs.\n"
"- **Development Phase**: Report newly added OSS components as development progresses.\n"
"- **Pre-Delivery Phase**: Submit complete, finalized OSS inventories for all release deliverables."
msgstr ""
"- **設計審查時**：在架構設計確定的階段提交預計採用的 OSS 清單\n"
"- **開發途中**：隨開發進展，隨時回報新採用的 OSS\n"
"- **交付前**：提交最終產出物所含所有 OSS 的完整清單"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:23
msgid "Setting milestones too late hampers remediation, while requiring reporting too early creates administrative churn; establish milestone cadences appropriate for project scale."
msgstr ""
"時機太晚會使發現問題時難以處理，太早則變更頻繁、管理繁瑣。\n"
"重點在於依專案的規模與性質，找出適當的平衡。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:24
msgid "**Inventory Data Fields**"
msgstr "**提交資訊的內容**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:25
msgid "Require suppliers to provide the following data fields in OSS disclosures:"
msgstr "要求 OSS 清單至少包含以下資訊："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:26
msgid ""
"- OSS component name and exact version.\n"
"- License type and SPDX identifier.\n"
"- Source repository URL.\n"
"- Usage scope and technical coupling mechanism.\n"
"- Details of modifications made to the OSS component.\n"
"- Dependency tree details (transitive dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"- OSS 名稱與版本\n"
"- 授權條款種類\n"
"- 取得來源（儲存庫 URL 等）\n"
"- 使用目的與範圍\n"
"- 是否修改及修改內容（若有修改）\n"
"- 相依性（該 OSS 所依賴的其他 OSS）"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:27
msgid "### Executing License Clearance"
msgstr "### 執行授權清查"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:28
msgid "**Defining Clearance Responsibilities**"
msgstr "**明確清查流程**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:29
msgid "Clarify boundaries and expectations for license clearance workflows:"
msgstr "若要求供應商執行 OSS 授權清查（為遵守授權條款而進行的確認流程），請明確其範圍與方式："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:30
msgid ""
"- **Responsible Entity**: Specify whether clearance is executed by supplier, buyer, or jointly.\n"
"- **Milestones**: Specify development phases where clearance must occur.\n"
"- **Acceptance Criteria**: Define explicit clearance criteria for delivery approval.\n"
"- **Tooling Mandates**: Specify required Software Composition Analysis (SCA) tooling if applicable."
msgstr ""
"- **執行主體**：由供應商端執行、由委託端執行，或雙方都執行\n"
"- **執行時期**：在開發的哪個階段執行\n"
"- **核准基準**：什麼樣的結果才會被核准\n"
"- **工具的使用**：是否要求使用特定的 SCA 工具"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:31
msgid "**Submitting Clearance Deliverables**"
msgstr "**提交清查結果**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:32
msgid "Define required formats for clearance deliverables—such as automated SCA scan reports or audited compliance checklists."
msgstr ""
"若已執行授權清查，請訂出要以何種形式提交結果。\n"
"請指定可驗證的形式，例如 SCA 工具的輸出報告，或人工確認時的檢核清單形式等。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:33
msgid "### Security Requirements"
msgstr "### 資訊安全要求"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:34
msgid "**Vulnerability Scanning Requirements**"
msgstr "**執行弱點掃描**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:35
msgid "Define security scanning requirements for supplier deliverables:"
msgstr "訂出要求供應商對所使用 OSS 執行已知弱點掃描時的要件："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:36
msgid ""
"- **Scanning Cadence**: Require scans during development and prior to final delivery.\n"
"- **Severity Thresholds**: Prohibit unmitigated Critical/High vulnerabilities; require formal risk reviews for Medium issues.\n"
"- **Remediation SLA**: Define remediation expectations (patching, workarounds, component replacement)."
msgstr ""
"- **執行掃描的時機**：開發中、交付前等\n"
"- **可容許的弱點等級**：Critical／High 弱點不可接受，Medium 以下需諮詢等\n"
"- **弱點處理方針**：對發現弱點的處理方式（修正、緩解措施、改用替代 OSS 等）"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:37
#: operation-templates/using/using-oss.md:36
msgid "For details, see the security evaluation section in [Evaluating Open Source Software](../using/evaluation.md)."
msgstr "細節請參閱[OSS 的評估方法](../using/evaluation.md)的資訊安全評估小節。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:38
msgid "**Post-Delivery Vulnerability Response**"
msgstr "**應對資訊安全更新**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:39
msgid "Establish post-delivery vulnerability protocols in supplier contracts:"
msgstr "對交付後才發現弱點時的處理方式，事先取得共識也很重要："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:40
msgid ""
"- Mandatory security update provisions during maintenance windows.\n"
"- Emergency notification SLA for newly disclosed Critical vulnerabilities.\n"
"- Standard response SLAs for patch delivery."
msgstr ""
"- 維護期間內提供資訊安全更新的義務\n"
"- 發現重大弱點時的聯絡體制\n"
"- 到提供更新為止的標準期間"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:41
msgid "### Contractual Provisions"
msgstr "### 評估契約條款"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:42
msgid "**Legal Terms**"
msgstr "**法律上的約定事項**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:43
msgid "Collaborate with Legal to incorporate open source terms into procurement contracts:"
msgstr ""
"有關 OSS 使用的法律約定，需要與法務部門協作謹慎評估。\n"
"以下是一般性評估項目的範例，實際寫入契約書的內容請務必取得法務部門的確認："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:44
msgid ""
"- Liability and indemnification for licensing non-compliance.\n"
"- Intellectual property warranty coverage for embedded open source components.\n"
"- Warranty scopes and disclaimers for open source software.\n"
"- Remedies and source code delivery obligations triggered by copyleft terms."
msgstr ""
"- 發現不符合授權條件時的責任與處理\n"
"- 交付物所含 OSS 引起智慧財產權問題時的處理\n"
"- OSS 使用相關的保證與免責範圍\n"
"- 產生原始碼提供義務時的處理"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:45
msgid "## Post-Delivery Verification Workflows"
msgstr "## 取得後應進行的事項"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:46
msgid "Upon receiving supplier deliverables, execute verification checks against contractual agreements:"
msgstr "自供應商收到軟體後，需要依事前約定進行驗證，並在發現問題時妥善處理。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:47
msgid "### OSS Inventory Verification"
msgstr "### 確認 OSS 清單"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:48
msgid "**Auditing Submitted Disclosures**"
msgstr "**檢查提交清單的妥當性**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:49
msgid "Audit supplier OSS disclosures against the following criteria:"
msgstr "對供應商提交的 OSS 清單，從以下觀點加以確認："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:50
msgid ""
"- **Completeness**: Confirm all required fields (names, versions, licenses) are provided.\n"
"- **Consistency**: Verify recorded license terms match official records (e.g., [SPDX License List](https://spdx.org/licenses/)).\n"
"- **Timeliness**: Confirm inventories reflect final release builds rather than outdated drafts."
msgstr ""
"- **必填資訊的記載**：OSS 名稱、版本、授權條款種類等所要求的資訊是否全部記載\n"
"- **記載內容的一致性**：授權條款種類的記載是否與已知資訊（官方儲存庫或 [SPDX License List](https://spdx.org/licenses/) 等）矛盾，是否有明顯錯誤\n"
"- **資訊的即時性**：若開發中有新增或更新 OSS，是否反映了最終交付時點的組成（是否直接提交了開發途中的舊清單）"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:51
msgid "These checks verify list completeness and accuracy rather than placing full audit burdens on the buyer. Automated tools enhance verification precision."
msgstr "這些確認的用意不是要委託端獨自驗證所有內容，而是用來確認提交的清單是否有明顯缺漏或矛盾的觀點。若要更精確的驗證，下一項的工具比對相當有效。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:52
msgid "**Automated Tool Verification**"
msgstr "**以工具驗證**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:53
msgid "When feasible, use SCA or SBOM tools to audit supplier deliverables against submitted inventories, uncovering omitted components or misidentified licenses. Alternatively, require suppliers to submit automated SCA scan results alongside deliverables."
msgstr ""
"若可行，請使用 SCA 工具或 SBOM 產生工具，把供應商提交的清單與實際軟體內容進行比對。\n"
"這樣就能客觀確認清單是否有漏記、記載內容是否有誤。\n"
"若難以導入工具，也可以要求供應商端以工具執行驗證，並一併提交結果。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:54
msgid "### License Clearance Verification"
msgstr "### 檢查授權清查結果"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:55
msgid "**Reviewing Clearance Rigor**"
msgstr "**清查流程的妥適性**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:56
msgid "Review supplier license clearance results for operational rigor:"
msgstr "對供應商執行的授權清查，確認以下事項："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:57
msgid ""
"- Confirm all embedded OSS components were audited.\n"
"- Verify component licenses, technical coupling, and modifications were reviewed.\n"
"- Confirm deliverables satisfy pre-agreed acceptance criteria."
msgstr ""
"- **執行範圍**：是否已涵蓋所有 OSS\n"
"- **確認項目**：授權相容性、相依性、修改處等必要項目是否已確認\n"
"- **是否符合核准基準**：是否滿足事前訂定的基準"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:58
msgid "**Verifying License Compatibility**"
msgstr "**判斷授權相容性**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:59
msgid "Verify individual OSS component licenses against intended deployment models (internal use, binary distribution, SaaS delivery), paying close attention to:"
msgstr ""
"就個別 OSS 確認其授權條款是否符合預定的使用形態（公司內部使用、散布、SaaS 提供等）。\n"
"特別是以下情況需要注意："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:60
msgid ""
"- Scope impacts from copyleft licenses (GPL, AGPL).\n"
"- Dependencies requiring commercial licenses.\n"
"- Incompatible license combinations within deliverables."
msgstr ""
"- 含有原始碼提供義務授權條款 OSS 時的影響範圍\n"
"- 是否含有需要購買商用授權的 OSS\n"
"- 是否混用了彼此衝突的授權條款 OSS"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:61
msgid "For details, see [What Is a License?](../compliance/what-is-a-license.md) and [Licenses with Source Code Disclosure Obligations](../compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md)."
msgstr "細節請參閱[什麼是授權條款](../compliance/what-is-a-license.md)與[有原始碼提供義務的授權條款](../compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md)。"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:62
msgid "### Issue Remediation Protocols"
msgstr "### 發現問題時的處理"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:63
msgid "**Classifying Issues by Severity**"
msgstr "**問題的類別分類**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:64
msgid "Categorize identified non-compliance issues by severity to drive appropriate response workflows:"
msgstr "依重大性與緊急性把發現的問題加以分類："

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:65
msgid "**Critical Issues (Immediate Escalation & Blockers)**"
msgstr "**重大問題（需要立即處理）**"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:66
msgid ""
"- Copyleft software deployed in non-compliant architectures without fulfilling source disclosure terms.\n"
"- Unmitigated Critical/High security vulnerabilities.\n"
"- Material licensing non-compliance.\n"
"- Massive unapproved OSS additions."
msgstr ""
"- 有原始碼提供義務授權條款的 OSS 以未履行義務的形式被不當使用\n"
"- 含有 Critical／High 等級的弱點\n"
"- 處於不符合授權條件的狀態\n"
"- 含有大量未申報的 OSS"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:67
msgid "**Minor Issues (Remediated via Technical Alignment)**"
msgstr "**輕微問題（可透過協商與調整處理）**"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:68
msgid ""
"- Minor inventory typos or omitted metadata.\n"
"- Low/Medium vulnerability findings.\n"
"- Incomplete modification documentation."
msgstr ""
"- OSS 清單的漏記或誤記\n"
"- Medium 等級以下的弱點\n"
"- 修改處的文件化不足"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:69
msgid "**Executing Remediation**"
msgstr "**執行處理程序**"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:70
msgid "Execute remediation based on issue severity:"
msgstr "依問題的重大性，評估以下處理方式："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:71
msgid ""
"- **Issue Notification**: Issue formal remediation requests detailing non-compliance findings.\n"
"- **Mandatory Remediation**: Require suppliers to replace components, patch vulnerabilities, or supply missing notices within set SLAs.\n"
"- **Alternative Evaluation**: Discuss architectural refactoring if component replacement is infeasible.\n"
"- **Final Acceptance**: Re-audit deliverables post-remediation prior to formal acceptance."
msgstr ""
"- **向供應商指出問題並要求說明**：明確傳達問題內容，要求說明狀況\n"
"- **要求更正措施**：提出具體的更正內容（更換 OSS、修正弱點、補齊授權資訊等）與期限\n"
"- **評估替代方案**：若難以更正，協商改用替代 OSS 或變更使用方式\n"
"- **驗收判斷**：確認更正措施已執行後，判斷最終是否驗收"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:72
msgid "Escalate critical non-compliance issues to Legal and executive leadership immediately."
msgstr "重大問題需要上報法務部門，某些情況下也需要上報經營層。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:74
msgid "Consult the OSPO during supplier procurement in the following scenarios:"
msgstr "關於自供應商取得 OSS，建議在以下情況下及早洽詢 OSPO："

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:75
msgid ""
"- **Drafting Procurement Contracts**: Incorporating open source clauses into supplier master agreements.\n"
"- **Reviewing Complex Clearance Findings**: Evaluating ambiguous licensing terms or vulnerability risks.\n"
"- **Critical Non-Compliance Findings**: Handling unapproved copyleft components or severe vulnerabilities.\n"
"- **Disagreements with Suppliers**: Resolving technical or legal licensing disputes with suppliers."
msgstr ""
"- **訂定契約條件時**：評估 OSS 使用相關契約條款的階段\n"
"- **清查結果有疑慮時**：發現授權或弱點方面難以判斷的問題時\n"
"- **發現重大問題時**：有原始碼提供義務授權條款被不當使用、存在嚴重弱點等\n"
"- **與供應商見解不同時**：對 OSS 使用的妥適性，供應商與委託端見解分歧時"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:76
msgid "Early consultation prevents risk expansion and ensures appropriate remediation."
msgstr "及早諮詢可以防止問題擴大，並採取適切的應對措施。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:77
msgid "Establishing clear supplier expectations during contracting coupled with diligent delivery verification minimizes compliance risks."
msgstr ""
"從供應商取得含 OSS 的軟體時，事前適切的約定與交付後細緻的驗證相當重要。\n"
"在契約階段就明確設定方針，可以大幅減少後續的糾紛。"

#. type: 段落
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:78
msgid "Contact the OSPO with questions. Refer to \"[What Is an OSPO?](../about/ospo.md)\" for staff contacts."
msgstr ""
"若有不清楚之處或在判斷上猶豫，請及早洽詢 OSPO。\n"
"承辦人清單請參閱「[什麼是 OSPO](../about/ospo.md)」。"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:82
msgid ""
"- [ ] Defined sharing scope for supplier-facing approved OSS catalogs.\n"
"- [ ] Standardized OSS inventory submission formats (Excel, CSV, SPDX, CycloneDX).\n"
"- [ ] Established Legal-approved contract clause guidelines for OSS procurement.\n"
"- [ ] Defined severity tiers and decision-making authority for procurement non-compliance.\n"
"- [ ] Established escalation pathways and contacts.\n"
"- [ ] Established periodic communication cadence with key suppliers."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] 已決定提供給供應商的已導入 OSS 清單範圍\n"
"- [ ] 已標準化 OSS 清單的提交格式（Excel/CSV、SBOM 等）\n"
"- [ ] 已與法務部門協作建置 OSS 相關契約條款的指南\n"
"- [ ] 已明確問題重大性等級的定義與判斷權責人\n"
"- [ ] 已建置上報路徑與聯絡方式\n"
"- [ ] 已建立與供應商定期溝通的機制"

#. type: 註解
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:83
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"Customization Guide\n"
"\n"
"Guidance for expanding and refining content to match your company context following placeholder replacement.\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"\n"
"■ Standardizing Inventory Submission Formats\n"
"\n"
"Adopting standard Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) formats (SPDX, CycloneDX) streamlines post-delivery analysis. Use spreadsheet formats (Excel/CSV) if automated SBOM pipelines are not yet established.\n"
"\n"
"■ Contract Clause Guidelines\n"
"\n"
"Work with Legal to establish contract review workflows and boilerplate open source clauses for supplier contracts. Include explicit disclaimers that template clauses require Legal review before execution.\n"
"\n"
"■ Procurement Incident Response\n"
"\n"
"Define decision-making authority for procurement non-compliance, prepare communication templates, and establish standard SLAs for supplier remediation.\n"
"\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"-->"
msgstr ""
"<!--\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"客製化指南\n"
"\n"
"以下說明在佔位符替換之後，依自家公司狀況進行增補與調整的指引。\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"\n"
"■ 提供給供應商的 OSS 清單\n"
"\n"
"提供給供應商的已導入 OSS 清單時，請考量以下事項。\n"
"\n"
"考量重點：\n"
" * 適切設定清單的範圍（是所有 OSS，或只有特定類別）\n"
" * 建立清單的更新頻率與維護機制\n"
" * 明確供應商想使用清單外 OSS 時的流程\n"
"\n"
"初期階段只把主要的 OSS 列成清單，再分階段擴充，是比較務實的做法。\n"
"\n"
"■ 標準化 OSS 清單提交格式\n"
"\n"
"標準化提交格式可以讓收到後的分析更有效率。\n"
"\n"
"標準化重點：\n"
" * 評估採用標準的 SBOM (Software Bill of Materials) 格式（SPDX、CycloneDX 等）\n"
" * 若還沒準備好管理標準 SBOM 格式，可考慮以 Excel/CSV 格式取得\n"
"\n"
"也可以考慮依供應商的技術水準與規模，調整所要求資訊的詳細程度。\n"
"\n"
"■ 契約條款的指南\n"
"\n"
"因為需要應對企業特有的法律風險，建議只提供一般性的指引。\n"
"\n"
"建置重點：\n"
" * 與法務部門協作建立契約書審查流程\n"
" * 建置 OSS 相關契約條款的公司內部指南\n"
" * 依過去的糾紛案例把注意事項文件化\n"
"\n"
"若要提供契約書範本，請明確加註「僅為例示，需經法務部門確認」。\n"
"具法律拘束力的文件請避免由 OSPO 單獨判斷，務必要求法務部門參與，這相當重要。\n"
"\n"
"■ 建置問題處理流程\n"
"\n"
"與公司內部的決策流程保持一致相當重要。\n"
"\n"
"建置重點：\n"
" * 定義問題的重大性等級，並明確各等級的判斷權責人\n"
" * 準備與供應商溝通的範本\n"
" * 依問題類型設定標準的更正期間\n"
" * 建置上報路徑與聯絡方式\n"
"\n"
"累積過去發生的問題與其處理案例，作為知識庫加以運用，可以讓未來的問題處理更有效率。\n"
"\n"
"■ 流程的分階段成熟\n"
"\n"
"在整份指南中，建議持續改善以下幾點。\n"
"\n"
"持續改善重點：\n"
" * 初期階段先聚焦在基本要件，透過運作逐步細化\n"
" * 收集供應商的回饋，提高可執行性\n"
" * 把成功案例與失敗案例都文件化，促進組織性學習\n"
" * 不要單方面提出要求，而要設定同時考量供應商狀況的務實要件\n"
"\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"########################################################################################\n"
"-->"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/usage-faq.md:1
msgid "# OSS Usage FAQ"
msgstr "# OSS 使用常見問題"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/using/usage-faq.md:3
msgid "## Frequently Asked Questions About Using Open Source Software"
msgstr "## 開放原始碼軟體使用的常見問題"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/using/usage-faq.md:7
msgid ""
"- [ ] Collected and added common internal usage questions.\n"
"- [ ] Documented internal case studies and relevant legal precedents.\n"
"- [ ] Established directory guidelines for managing case studies as ticket volume grows.\n"
"- [ ] Kept the FAQ concise and avoided duplicating the rest of the documentation."
msgstr ""
"- [ ] 已收集並加入公司內部的常見問題\n"
"- [ ] 已整理並寫出具體的公司內部案例或外部判例\n"
"- [ ] 已決定案例增加後改以其他目錄管理的方針\n"
"- [ ] 已避免與整份文件重複，並簡明扼要地整理"

#. type: 註解
#: operation-templates/using/usage-faq.md:8
msgid ""
